---
layout: layouts/base.njk
type: hub
override:tags: []
title: Relationship Guides for Couples | Lovio
description: Practical, original guides for couples — long-distance date ideas, drawing ideas, games to play together and how to set up couples widgets.
h1: Guides for couples
crumbLabel: Guides
override:breadcrumbs: []
schemaType: CollectionPage
groups:
  - label: Long distance
    category: long-distance
  - label: Widgets & doodles
    category: widgets
  - label: Play together
    category: play
---
<section class="c-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Lovio guides</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Guides for <em>couples</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">Ideas you can use tonight — whether or not you use Lovio. Written by the Lovio team.</p>
</section>

{%- for group in groups %}
{%- set posts = collections.guides | whereData("category", group.category) %}
{%- if posts.length %}
<section class="c-group" aria-labelledby="group-{{ group.category }}">
    <h2 id="group-{{ group.category }}">{{ group.label }}</h2>
    <ul class="c-cards">
        {%- for post in posts %}
        <li>
            <a class="c-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
                <span class="c-card-kicker">{{ post.data.publishedAt | readableDate }}</span>
                <span class="c-card-title">{{ post.data.h1 }}</span>
                <span class="c-card-text">{{ post.data.description }}</span>
            </a>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
</section>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
